Description: Cross-platform disk space analyzer with treemap visualization
 DiskAtlas helps you find what is using space on your disks. Scan local
 drives, folders, and removable media, then explore results in treemap and
 tree views.
 .
 Features:
  - Treemap and tree views for disk usage
  - File type breakdown with customizable MIME categories
  - Export scan results to CSV
  - NTFS-aware scanning on Windows (where supported)
  - Automatic update checks (Help menu)
